stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Undefined

    Undefined --> Created: runtime create
    Created --> Mounted: runtime mount
    Mounted --> Active: application start

    Active --> Mounted: application exits or stops
    Mounted --> Created: runtime unmount
    Created --> Undefined: runtime destroy

    Created --> Created: inspect or verify
    Mounted --> Mounted: repeated mount is idempotent
    Active --> Active: status or logs

    Active --> CleanupRequired: abnormal launcher failure
    CleanupRequired --> Mounted: process cleanup completed
    CleanupRequired --> Created: owned resources removed
